    "description": "<p>When a Lunar believes she is being watched, she may activate this Charm to confuse or upset those who spy upon her. Observed Predator Instinct can end their observation or cause them to make mistakes. The character's player rolls (Appearance + [Presence or Performance] + Essence) against the target's Mental Defense Value. People who succumb receive the unmistakable impression that the Lunar knows they are watching her, is watching them</p><p>with equal care and is comfortable--if not pleased--with the arrangement.</p>",
